    "catalog:tags": "sink, inset sink, drainer, kitchen",
    "catalog:note": "Inset sink with one bowl and a drainer, set into a worktop at 0.90. rim 0.92. Bowl 0.40 x 0.34, 0.18 deep, as a rim plate with a through-hole and a liner below it. The tap stem and spout are thin and build as polygonal prisms. Bowl and tap sit left of centre: a mirrored copy keeps drainCenter, faucetMount and the ports where they are.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "EN 1116 sizes as given in the drafting standard key dimensions (sink 0.86 x 0.50, bowl 0.40 x 0.34 x 0.18, worktop 0.90); ports BS EN 12056-2 via the standard; sources not read, unverified",
